      "full_text": "Photos from 湯姆熊歡樂世界-台南海佃店's post\n#TOMS品牌商品來報報<br />\n⭐TOM'S 手指彈力遊戲機<br />\n-<br />\n藍色、黑色共兩色💙🖤<br />\n可愛小型手指版拳擊台！<br />\n可切換無/有音樂模式🔕<br />\n不想太吵雜也可以安靜遊玩！<br />\n適合與親子同樂朋友聚會PK遊玩🤼🤼🤼<br />\n看看誰材質最厲害的拳(手)擊(指)手！<br />\n-<br />\n▪ 材質：塑膠 (ＰＰ)、電子零件<br />\n▪ 尺寸：10.6×14.9×18.9 cm±5%<br />\n小編分數最多５００左右💥同事打到９９９!!!<br />\n✨預計１０月中可至各現場尋寶看看哦！✨<br />\n-<br />\n✨彩票資訊：<br />\n📍 一般會員｜彩票數 2150 張 <br />\n📍 VIP 會員 ｜彩票數 1720 張<br />\n<br />\n<img src=\"https://scontent-fra5-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/854194253_1555400806608190_2019427815694731742_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=109&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_ohc=qHO6LafzTFIQ7kNvwFQr57N&amp;_nc_oc=AdokN-jOp2zJ0D6WQcD9jLXochHbCk4bJGRG58xgwUgWRhEFIaa8lqxYgkU-bwwNu3w&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=aj7I2UfQ5C6eHVE4BmrIGA&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQIQOcd4Inx5uUd9Vz9QUs3V_IvkSi8OECgkJU5PI_GBOIbNC0xwfFBL2nl_RUtfTQ82LmfdYNu0&amp;oh=00_AQOAJdxn36erhWzmgDo_9-t20nLlNokdJOwGkVRns75NGw&amp;oe=6ADBA923\" /><br />\n<br />\n<img height=\"720\" src=\"https://scontent-fra3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/852275098_1555400836608187_8841894877258848294_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=105&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_ohc=bwoE94lMkJoQ7kNvwGcK2Tj&amp;_nc_oc=AdqeHGhQzXfEDselFBdEq96nO-Qu9sgPdzl7YeCuxgiKk7QgRHe3tjdPd2yreSIA7zE&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=aj7I2UfQ5C6eHVE4BmrIGA&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKC8npmh0KNATb_eVpbyOIy_6i3R7UrV6tUs6n0-_r8zoRumF9ouLpSpEfNomP_Yr6cHNKrmB3N&amp;oh=00_AQNyKOIKI5iDD2yiLpkQldWT73ov8pwGEe_zSrqX9Udnww&amp;oe=6ADBB2B8\" width=\"960\" /><br />\n<br />\n<img height=\"720\" src=\"https://scontent-fra3-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/854246055_1555400873274850_8856064918901545395_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=104&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_ohc=GtFnqPr2_7oQ7kNvwEgrbBO&amp;_nc_oc=Adqd3MqwO5_HOJ9uQXC2Cw6qOkTj11qFaUE4TxuumWARIIw9x44tph3o6PsFe9WyoYA&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-